@AppointmentService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5138

### Full health report, including the database check
GET {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/health

### Liveness only — does not touch the database
GET {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/health/live

### OpenAPI document
GET {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json

### Swagger UI is served at {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/swagger


### ===== Demo data (seeded automatically on first run, see AppointmentDbInitializer) =====
# DemoClinicId          11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
# DemoSecondClinicId    11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111112
# DemoVeterinarianId       22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222221  (Dr. Ana Petrova, General Practice, Central Vet Clinic)
# DemoSecondVeterinarianId 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222  (Dr. Marko Ivanov, Surgery, Central Vet Clinic)
# DemoThirdVeterinarianId  22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222223  (Dr. Elena Trajkova, Dermatology, North Animal Hospital)
# DemoOwnerId           33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333  (already has one upcoming appointment)
# DemoPetId             44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444


### List all clinics
GET {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/api/clinics

### Search clinics by location
GET {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/api/clinics?location=Skopje


### List all veterinarians
GET {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/api/veterinarians

### Veterinarians at one clinic
GET {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/api/veterinarians?clinicId=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Veterinarians by specialization
GET {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/api/veterinarians?specialization=Surgery


### Open availability slots for a specific veterinarian (copy an AvailabilitySlotId from the
### response — you'll need one to book below)
GET {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/api/availability-slots?veterinarianId=22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222221

### Open availability slots on a specific date
GET {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/api/availability-slots?date=2026-08-06


### Upcoming appointments for the demo owner (should show the pre-seeded "Annual check-up")
GET {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/upcoming?ownerId=33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333


### Book an appointment — replace availabilitySlotId with one from the search above.
### NOTE: real pet-ownership verification calls the Pet Service (PetService:BaseUrl in
### appsettings.json). If Pet Service isn't running/reachable, this will fail with 404/500 — that's
### expected until both services are up together.
POST {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "petId": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
  "ownerId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "availabilitySlotId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "reason": "Routine vaccination"
}

### Cancel an appointment — replace {id} with an AppointmentId from a previous response.
POST {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Owner requested cancellation"
}

### Reschedule an appointment onto a different open slot — replace both ids.
POST {{AppointmentService_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/reschedule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newAvailabilitySlotId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}
